OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBands of
OL,6,Fheavy showers and thunderstorms will
OL,7,Fdevelop and move northwards across
OL,8,FEngland, Wales and perhaps Northern
OL,9,FIreland, though sporadic in nature.
OL,10,FScotland likely to remain dry with
OL,11,Fclear spells. Feeling warm and humid,
OL,12,Fleading to an uncomfortable night.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FBands of heavy showers and
OL,15,Fthunderstorms will continue to move
OL,16,Fnorthwards through the day. Sunnier
OL,17,Fmoments in between, where it will feel
OL,18,Fvery warm and humid, especially in the
OL,19,Fsouth.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
